  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the capacity to produce and market high quality mild arabica coffee.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Smallholder coffee farmers primary cooperative.Beneficiaries: More than 2,500 smallholder farmers, families and local economic service providers will benefit directly and indirectly. More than 1,000 women will benefit directly and indirectly through employment, increased income and uplift in livelihoods,.Description: The overall objective of the project is to increase the production and marketing of high quality arabica coffee. This will be realized through grant and technical assistance to have in place a revolving fund for inputs, crop purchase working capital, training in good agricultural practices and adapting climate smart agricultural skills leading to production of high-quality coffee.</narrative>
  </description>
